<title>USA: Vons sees Q4 EPS of $0.73-$0.78.</title>
<headline>Vons sees Q4 EPS of $0.73-$0.78.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANTON, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vons Cos Inc, a southern California supermarket operator that has agreed to merge with Safeway Inc, said Monday it would earn $0.73-$0.78 a share in the fourth quarter, up from $0.48 a year ago.</p>
<p>For the full year, Vons said it estimates earnings of $2.29-$2.34 a share, compared to $1.55 in 1995.</p>
<p>Analysts have forecast earnings of $0.61 a share in the fourth quarter and $2.12 for the year, according to First Call.</p>
</text>
